@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending : player or reader edit,\nwith any new IDs fixed
Pending : in the served copy, saved with the edit;\nreplayed again on completion, discard\nor import
Pending --> Conflict : a rebuild finds it no longer applies\nto the accepted copy
Conflict : stored by the rebuild, left out of\nthe served copy; decided by hand
Pending --> Claimed : agent claims a batch\n(records the accepted\ncopy's SHA-256)
Claimed : still in the served copy until the batch\nis completed; writing the file\nchanges nothing served
Claimed --> Completed : agent writes document.json,\ncompletes the batch (imports the file)
Conflict --> Completed : agent completes\nthe batch
Claimed --> Completed : complete unchanged, only if\nnot_adopted, comment or review-request
Pending --> [*] : discarded by\nthe player
Completed : outcome: applied, already_correct,\nnot_adopted or reviewed
Completed --> [*]
@enduml
